WEBVTT

1
00:13:49.829 --> 00:13:50.819
You awake?

2
00:13:57.295 --> 00:13:58.456
You hungry?

3
00:13:58.546 --> 00:13:59.661
Always.

4
00:13:59.964 --> 00:14:01.250
You got it.

5
00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:19.306
Spread to the edges!

6
00:14:45.385 --> 00:14:47.797
Where is that cash from?

7
00:14:48.096 --> 00:14:49.632
Work.

8
00:14:50.473 --> 00:14:51.463
One more-job.

9
00:14:51.557 --> 00:14:54.094
Then I'm done.

10
00:14:55.395 --> 00:14:57.056
You don't

11
00:14:57.146 --> 00:14:58.386
belong

12
00:14:58.481 --> 00:14:59.812
in that world.

13
00:15:04.987 --> 00:15:07.319
You heard me.

14
00:20:19.385 --> 00:20:20.420
I approve.

15
00:20:20.511 --> 00:20:21.967
Of the song?

16
00:20:22.054 --> 00:20:24.170
Of the girl.

17
00:41:47.296 --> 00:41:49.663
So who's Debora?

18
00:41:50.341 --> 00:41:52.252
The girl.

19
00:42:00.601 --> 00:42:01.932
I'm done.

20
00:42:15.908 --> 00:42:16.864
Pizza?

21
00:42:16.951 --> 00:42:19.283
Are we celebrating?

22
00:42:19.954 --> 00:42:21.536
Celebrating you getting

23
00:42:21.622 --> 00:42:23.158
a real job.

24
00:42:24.667 --> 00:42:26.123
What kind of job?

25
00:42:26.461 --> 00:42:27.542
Wouldn't it be good

26
00:42:27.628 --> 00:42:31.041
to bring joy to people

27
00:42:31.132 --> 00:42:34.375
when you drive?

28
00:43:19.180 --> 00:43:20.670
Look...

29
00:43:21.265 --> 00:43:23.381
You only have to
wash your hands once

30
00:43:23.476 --> 00:43:25.137
after counting that.

31
00:43:25.812 --> 00:43:26.847
I know.

32
00:43:27.313 --> 00:43:28.599
And not put

33
00:43:28.689 --> 00:43:30.430
other lives

34
00:43:30.525 --> 00:43:31.515
in danger.

35
00:43:31.943 --> 00:43:35.481
I won't let anything bad
happen to you.

36
00:43:36.489 --> 00:43:37.900
I'm not talking

37
00:43:37.990 --> 00:43:39.355
about me.

38
01:28:10.911 --> 01:28:12.322
I'm not blind!

39
01:28:23.048 --> 01:28:24.083
I don't want

40
01:28:24.174 --> 01:28:25.790
your dirty money!

41
01:29:48.466 --> 01:29:50.207
Will you come back?

42
01:29:52.429 --> 01:29:54.136
I don't know.

43
01:29:55.056 --> 01:29:57.673
Is everything going to be OK?

44
01:30:01.271 --> 01:30:04.559
I promised nothing
would happen to you.

45
01:30:04.649 --> 01:30:06.640
And I failed.

46
01:30:07.360 --> 01:30:09.727
But you're safe now.

47
01:30:10.238 --> 01:30:13.447
I'm not talking about me.

48
01:30:25.629 --> 01:30:26.790
Good

49
01:30:26.880 --> 01:30:28.245
luck.
